<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica board says no sale on Sept 25 maize tender.</title>
<headline>SAfrica board says no sale on Sept 25 maize tender.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Maize Board said on Thursday there was no sale for the export of 33,000 tonnes of white maize for shipment in October and November out of Durban.</p>
<p>The export tender closed on late on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
